\# FINAL EXPECTATION\
\
The updated system must support this complete business workflow:\
\
\*\*Sales receives enquiry → Selects or customises itinerary → Sends through Email/WhatsApp → Follow-ups happen automatically according to configurable days → Client confirms → Sales generates proforma invoice → Client pays token amount → Accounts verifies payment → Sales receives notification → Final financial confirmation → System routes the same booking to destination Operations → Operations books hotels and transportation → Accounts processes supplier payments → Arrival and departure arrangements are coordinated → Tour is executed → Financial reconciliation and tour closure.\*\*\
\
The Backend team maintains the master itineraries, hotel information, transportation information, and other master data.\
\
Sales owns the client relationship, itinerary sharing, customisation, follow-ups, and booking handover.\
\
Operations owns actual hotel and transportation bookings, destination execution, and operational updates.\
\
Accounts owns financial rate approvals, payment verification, supplier payments, and financial confirmation.\
\
Management must be able to monitor every stage.\
\
\*\*The central objective is that no department should have to maintain a separate Excel sheet or depend on repeated phone calls to understand the current status of a tour.\*\*\
\
One Enquiry ID, one connected booking, one Tour Code, and one shared source of truth across the entire organisation.\
\
Implement these requirements as updates to the existing DMC system while preserving all previously completed functionality.\